     1,
     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div lang=\"KO\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\">\r\n<div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222;background:white\">Dear Sir or Madam</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">Thanks for providing the methylKit R package. I think it is one of the most useful program for methylation study.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">I would like to ask whether the program has another annotate function. <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">I know there is annotation function &quot;getAssociationWithTss()&quot;<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">However, I would like get my DMR data with annotation of region(promoter, exon,intron,intergenic..etc) line by line. <u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">(ex)<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">   id          chr        start           end strand coverage numCs numTs</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\"> region</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">1<span> </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"><a href=\"http://chr21.17806094.17808094.na/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://chr21.17806094.17808094.na/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793234001860000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3lyp_n8CCyk1ovRr41ExJI\"><span style=\"color:black;text-decoration:none\">chr21.17806094.17808094.NA</span></a></span><span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\"> </span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">chr21\r\n 17806094 17808094 + 1834 7 1827</span><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:blue\"> promoter</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\"><u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:black\"><a href=\"http://2.chr21.