ot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">I look forward to hearing from you.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">Regards,<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"background:white\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#222222\">Jongbum Kim.<u></u><u></u></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><u></u> <u></u></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
